<div>
<div class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Workspace</p><h1 class="page-title">Pengaturan</h1><p class="page-description">Identitas toko dan keamanan akses owner.</p></div></div><x-feedback/>
<div class="grid items-start gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
<section class="panel p-6"><span class="mb-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#ecfaf5] text-brand-primary"><x-icon name="leaf"/></span><h2 class="text-base font-semibold">Identitas toko</h2><p class="mb-6 mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-brand-textGray">Nama ini ditampilkan di navigasi dan nota penjualan yang dicetak.</p><form wire:submit="updateStore" class="space-y-5"><label class="field">Nama toko<input class="input" wire:model="store_name" maxlength="150" required></label><button class="btn btn-primary" wire:loading.attr="disabled">Simpan nama toko</button></form></section>
<section class="panel p-6"><span class="mb-5 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#ecfaf5] text-brand-primary"><x-icon name="settings"/></span><h2 class="text-base font-semibold">Ubah password</h2><p class="mb-6 mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-brand-textGray">Gunakan minimal 12 karakter. Setelah berhasil, seluruh sesi akan dicabut dan Anda perlu masuk kembali.</p><form wire:submit="updatePassword" class="space-y-4"><label class="field">Password saat ini<input class="input" type="password" wire:model="current_password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label><label class="field">Password baru<input class="input" type="password" wire:model="new_password" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="12" required></label><label class="field">Konfirmasi password baru<input class="input" type="password" wire:model="new_password_confirmation" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="12" required></label><button class="btn btn-primary" wire:loading.attr="disabled">Ubah password & keluar</button></form></section>
</div></div>
